   "kind": "faq",
   "stage": ["question"],
   "text": {
    "en": "What does the shahada mean? The first half takes away every false object of worship and affirms Allah alone. The second half says Allah sent Muhammad to all people with the Qur'an, so you trust what he told and follow his way of worship."
   },
