   "kind": "faq",
   "stage": ["question"],
   "text": {
    "en": "Is my past forgiven when I become Muslim? The Prophet said that Islam wipes out what came before it. A new Muslim begins with a clean page, and the Qur'an tells those who feel they have gone too far not to despair of Allah's mercy."
   },
