   "id": "new_muslim_faq.faq.005",
   "kind": "faq",
   "stage": ["question"],
   "text": {
    "en": "Why do we wash before prayer? The Qur'an commands wudu, and the Prophet said the prayer of one who has broken their wudu is not accepted until they make it again. The Qur'an names four parts: the face, the arms to the elbows, wiping the head, and the feet to the ankles."
   },
   "ageBand": ["adult", "13-17"],
