   "text": {
    "en": "What if I do not know the prayer yet? The Prophet once told a man to go back and pray again until he prayed well, then taught him: say the takbir, recite, bow until at ease, stand, prostrate until at ease, sit until at ease, and do the same through the prayer. Learn it a step at a time."
   },
